Once a proud hotbed for professional wrestling, Pacific Northwest is now among the last of a dying breed. An NWA territory through and through, PNW has struggled to survive the changing landscape of television and wrestling. Despite the efforts of Don Owen, PNW has seen a massive decline as stars have left the terrirtory behind for the greener pastures of the national wrestling promotions.
